#. Key:	41596F554AC689A4223BC2A3BC17DDDD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/W_TelemetryDialogue.W_TelemetryDialogue_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/W_TelemetryDialogue.W_TelemetryDialogue_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",41596F554AC689A4223BC2A3BC17DDDD"
msgid "Budget Backrooms is now able to collect anonymized telemetry data of your in-game position on the levels you explore. This data is used to generate a heatmap of the most frequently walked areas or paths of the map.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"What the game sends:\r\n"
"- Your SteamID to generate a hashed session token. Your SteamID is NOT stored anywhere. The session token cannot be traced back to you so you cannot be identified from the positions sent.\r\n"
"- In-world position samples are sent every 60s.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A new session token is generated when this option is enabled and at game startup.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"For any concerns or questions, contact me at dabardev@dabar.dev or dabardibid@proton.me"
msgstr "Budget Backrooms现在能够收集您在探索各个层级时游戏内位置的匿名遥测数据。这些数据将用于生成地图上最常被走动的区域或路径的热力图。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"游戏会发送以下数据：\r\n"
"\r\n"
"您的 SteamID 将用于生成经过哈希处理的会话令牌。您的 SteamID 不会被存储。请放心，该会话令牌无法追溯至您本人，无法通过发送的位置信息识别出您的身份。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"每隔 60 秒发送一次游戏内的位置样本。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"当您启用此选项以及每次启动游戏时，都会生成一个新的会话令牌。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"如果您有任何疑虑或问题，请通过 dabardev@dabar.dev 或 dabardibid@proton.me 与我联系"

