#. Key:	4C8AA8F349D731711BF25ABAB9A3F1AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/W_GMSelect/W_GMSelect.W_GMSelect_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_8.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/W_GMSelect/W_GMSelect.W_GMSelect_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_8.Text
msgctxt "Game,4C8AA8F349D731711BF25ABAB9A3F1AB"
msgid "'Unused Levels' are a part of this game's big ass size. Here you find a list of playable, unused levels, that didn't made it into the Classic Gamemode or any gamemode at all. Developer stuff is also included if you're lazy to use the in-game console.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"List may change :)\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Levels may restart the game at unexpected times, have patience.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Note: Discord RPC *may* not be visible because I'm too lazy or I didn't want to add it into the level"
msgstr "这些废案层级就是这游戏体积如此庞大的原因之一。在这里，您可以找到一份可玩的废案层级列表——这些都是没能入选经典模式或其他模式的层级。如果您懒得用游戏内控制台，我们也为您提供了一些开发者专属的妙妙工具。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"列表随时可能变动 :)\r\n"
"\r\n"
"这些层级可能会在您意想不到的时候把游戏搞重启，请耐心点。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"请注意：Discord RPC *可能*不会显示，因为我太懒了，或者我压根就不想把它加进这些层级里"

