#. Key:	54EB8E24458BB63DB97315A74E25F00A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/W_GMSelect/W_GMSelect.W_GMSelect_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_11.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/W_GMSelect/W_GMSelect.W_GMSelect_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_11.Text
msgctxt "Game,54EB8E24458BB63DB97315A74E25F00A"
msgid "Even though I had no place to put Gamemode in title, this is The Memerooms™. A goofy ahh refined experience of Budget Backrooms.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"I've inserted 21st century humor (probably unfunny) into the game, what's the worst that could happen?\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Modifiers:\r\n"
"- Howlers? Out, replaced with NextBots chasing you like they're after a rare NFT.\r\n"
"- Stamina endless like the queue for toilet paper in the early days of the pandemic.\r\n"
"- Player Speed faster than my dad going for milk.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"[UNFUNNY WARNING, PROCEED WITH CAUTION! SOME CONTENT IS UNFINISHED]"
msgstr "虽然我没法把“游戏模式”这几个字塞进标题里，但这确实是《梗室™》。一场由Budget Backrooms精心打造的离谱沙雕体验。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"我在游戏里塞满了一大堆21世纪的互联网烂梗（呃..虽然可能并不好笑），但还能糟到哪里去呢？\r\n"
"\r\n"
"模式特性：\r\n"
"-嚎叫者？拜拜了您嘞。 我们把他解雇了，现在将是 NextBot 来追着你咬，那架势就像在抢限量版 NFT。\r\n"
"-无限体力。就像老板画的大饼，永远也吃不完...\r\n"
"-玩家移速极快。比下课冲食堂的高中生还要快。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"[不好笑警告，请谨慎选择该模式！部分内容尚未完工]"

