msgctxt "Game,F64B0AE84B3F7AE51702F4BD80D1622B"
msgid "I just caught you in 4K trying to bypass The Memerooms, I don't want to be mean to you but you have to play how it was intended.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Looks like your save says you didn't finish the Classic Gamemode yet. Please come back when you finish the game at least once! (Classic Gamemode)"
msgstr "别以为我不知道你想耍小聪明直接进 The Memerooms，我可是看得一清二楚。当然不是我想为难你，但游戏还得按原本的设计来玩。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"你这个存档还没通关经典模式呢，起码打通一次再回来吧！（经典模式）"

